          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We Distribute, Yet Things Multiply"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.088,
            0.848,
            0.127
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "numbers could be any integers. Mathematical statements that express the equality of two algebraic expressions, such as"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.408,
            0.13,
            0.589,
            0.15
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_3_equation_3.jpg",
          "content": "a \\left( b + 8 \\right) = ab + 8a,"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.338,
            0.16,
            0.659,
            0.18
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_3_equation_4.jpg",
          "content": "( a + 1 )   ( b - 1 ) = a b + b - a - 1 ,   { \\mathrm { e t c . } } ,"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.184,
            0.362,
            0.204
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "are called "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "identities.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.214,
            0.847,
            0.254
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ By how much will the product of two numbers change if one of the numbers is increased by m and the other by n?"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.257,
            0.848,
            0.295
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "If a and b are the initial numbers being multiplied, they become "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a + m"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "b + n"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.329,
            0.299,
            0.67,
            0.349
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_3_equation_8.jpg",
          "content": "\\begin{aligned}\\left( a + m \\right) \\left( b + n \\right) &= (a + m)b + (a + m)n \\\\&= ab + mb + an + mn.\\end{aligned}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.354,
            0.439,
            0.372
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The increase is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a n + b m + m n"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.372,
            0.849,
            0.411
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Notice that the product is the sum of the product of each term of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "( a + m )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " with each term of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "( b + n )"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.268,
            0.423,
            0.721,
            0.493
          ],
